      "writtenOn": "2024-04-15T01:08:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since pipe FDs is not marked as O_NONBLOCK, read function would block until FD getting closed or receives any data.\n\nFrom man pipe(7): \nIf all file descriptors referring to the write end of a pipe have been closed, then an attempt to read(2) from the pipe will see end-of-file (read(2) will return 0).\n\nSo I think waitpid is already covered with receiving zero for the read function.",
      "parentUuid": "6029d01b_f8c759c8",
